  },
  "section": "3.177",
  "rulesText": "You can call on the aid of an otherworldly steed. You always have the Find Steed spell prepared.\n\nYou can also cast the spell once without expending a spell slot, and you regain the ability to do so when you finish a Long Rest."
}
